"option_b": "To protect the highly sensitive, friction-prone pyrotechnic composition from being chipped or accidentally ignited by impact during shipping and handling",
"option_c": "To act as a waterproof seal that must be removed before firing",
"option_d": "To slow down the flame",
"correct_answer": "B",
"explanation": "The pyrotechnic bead on an e-match is extremely sensitive to friction and impact. The plastic shroud acts as a bumper guard, ensuring the tip doesn't strike hard surfaces during transport and handling."
